    "zh": "芽芽需要比当前多 2 格电量。扫描电量，把它存进变量，加上 2 后提交新读数。",
    "en": "Sprout needs two more units of energy. Scan the battery, store the reading, then add two and submit the new value."
  },
  "hints": [
    {
      "zh": "同一个变量可以先读取，再用加完的结果更新。",
      "en": "You can read a variable, add to its value, and save the answer back under the same name."
    }
