    {
      "text": {
        "zh": "先用「读取电池读数」。变量 energy 现在保存着扫描到的数值。",
        "en": "Start with Read the Battery. The variable energy now holds the scanned value."
      },
      "target": "palette"
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "zh": "接上「给电池补能」，把菜单选成 2。",
        "en": "Add Recharge the Battery and choose 2 from its menu."
